57,"revGrowth":0.171,"earnGrowth":0.233,"fwdEps":null,"peg":null,"grossMargins":0.28264,"summary":"Deep Polymers Limited manufactures and sells filler masterbatches in India. The company offers white, black, color, and UV, as well as additive masterbatches, including antiblock, antifog, antimicrobial/bactiblock additive, antioxidant, antirodent, antistatic, desiccant, flame retardant, nucleating and clarifying agent, optical brightener, oxo biodegradable, PPA, and slip masterbatches. It also provides antifab fillers, such as calcium filler PP/PE, calcium filler PP/PE  lamination, super brightener filler, coloured tinge filler, natural filler  TPFN 001, and process modifier. In addition, the company offers non-woven, PP multifilament, and biodegradable master batches. Its products are used in HDPE; PP; LDPE; LLDPE; FBLK007- black tone; PPCP; PS; HIPS; blown film/cast film/mono layer/multi layer; pipes; automotive compound PE/PP/glass filled; engineering compound PC/ABS/nylon; antifab filler PP/PE; ABS; SAN; PP/PE tape extrusion; PP/PE lamination; PP/PE injection and blow moulding; PP box strapping; PP/PE calendaring process; PP non-woven; bio-degradable oxo/compostible; PET optical fiber; PET bottle; polyester sheet; and engineering masterbatch PC/ABS/PBT/nylon/PET applications. Deep Polymers Limited was founded in 1992 and is based in Gandhinagar, India.","employees":120,"earnDates":[],"exDiv":null,"asOf":1795529283},"analyst":null,"cap":"Penny","caFix":null,"fetched":1795529283,"source":"Yahoo Finance (public chart, fundamentals-timeseries & quoteSummary endpoints)","news":{"q":"\"Deep Polymers\" when:90d","items":[{"t":"Deep Polymers Ltd is Rated Hold by MarketsMOJO","s":"MarketsMojo","d":1795439934,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxPY2FteF95UTU2RUduUXFoTE8ydmtjVUVDTlpRZkNLLVNCc293cWRtTE9PWGNRRms5Y2htVnNWRldxOXZoZE9aS1ZBQ3M4LXEya0F4UmRiS2ZXTjlCTFplbjZIVVhFSjkyeGR1MDNnTjhXcGQtMW9CWUVkeTFxZFg4amFTNWhSZ2I4TDJXNjZXdmJrbzBmVWlUelU0V29aSlA3SUhKR